<speak>A cup of tea and a little time outside sounds like a pleasant way to continue the day. I'll let you get back to that rather than keep you on the line. Thank you again for your time, Adrian. For the general account-administration matters we discussed, the usual secure channels remain available whenever you need them. I hope the family enjoys the quieter plans you've been making, and that the new routine gives you some comfortable time away from the office.</speak>